RESOLUTION NO.
ENTITLED:  "A RESOLUTION RE-APPROPRIATING THE FISCAL YEAR 2013 BUDGET OF THE CITY OF
     CHEYENNE ACCORDING TO THE PROVISIONS OF W.S. 16-4-112 & 16-4-113."
BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE CITY OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING:
     That the Municipal Budget of the City of Cheyenne for Fiscal Year 2013 be re-appropriated
     as follows:
